# Gabriel Overview Doc

- Read `Custom/Scripts/Gabriel/FEATURE.md` and
  `Custom/Scripts/Gabriel/docs/RUNTIME-OPTIMIZATION-HISTORY.md` before changing
  Gabriel overview docs.
- Keep `Custom/Scripts/Gabriel/FEATURE.md` aligned with bootstrap injection
  (`GabrielBootstrap.sessionPlugins`), `GabrielSessionPlugins.cslist`
  membership, and the runtime optimization history link.
- When adding a new `Custom/Scripts/Gabriel/features/*/` or `tools/*/` area, add
  the row to `FEATURE.md`, ensure that folder has its own `FEATURE.md`, and add
  matching `.cursor/rules` / `.cursor/skills` guidance if missing.
- If the change crosses into a specific Gabriel area, still update the adjacent
  `FEATURE.md` for that area.
